# mpc
# Music Player Client.
# Program for controlling the Music Player Daemon (MPD).
# More information: <https://www.musicpd.org/clients/mpc>.
# Toggle play/pause:
mpc toggle
# Stop playing:
mpc stop
# Show information about the currently playing song:
mpc status
# Play next song:
mpc next
# Play previous song:
mpc prev
# Forward or rewind the currently playing song:
mpc [+-]seconds
# Music Player Client: control the Music Player Daemon (MPD).
# See also: `mpd`, `ncmpcpp`, `cmus`.
